{
    "title": "Rock ID - Stone Identifier",
    "description": "Rock ID\u2014your digital rock identifier and guide to the world of rocks. Discover your passion for geology with our top-notch stone identifier and rock scanner! If you\u2019re into gems, rocks, stones, gemstones, and minerals and dream about assembling the ultimate collection of magic crystals, then look no further than Rock ID. With our expert stone and crystal identifier, no gem will slip through your hands! Use our swift rock scanner to recognize precious gems in mere seconds and add them to your custom collection. \r\n\r\nWhat can Rock ID do?\r\n\r\n1. Recognize stones.\r\n\r\nSnap a picture of any gem, crystal, rock, stone, fossil, or mineral and get an instant recognition result. Powered by AI, our search engine will identify your rock out of thousands of other stones gathered in its vast database. \r\n\r\n2. Help with gem appraisal.\r\n\r\nIt\u2019s hard to tell the difference between real and fake diamonds, pearls, and jade stones, especially if you\u2019re only starting your journey as a rock enthusiast. Use our smart AI scanner to recognize your rocks and see if you have an authentic gemstone or a similar cheaper rock.\r\n\r\n3. Provide insightful rock facts.\r\n\r\nDid you know that igneous rocks are formed from magma? Or that real diamonds can cut glass? You can learn all about that and even more from our stone profiles. Each rock, crystal, gem, and stone in the app has a comprehensive description of its features, history, usage, occurrence, and even interesting facts you may have never guessed!\r\n\r\n4. Manage gemstone collections.\r\n\r\nNever lose your marbles\u2014keep all your minerals in one place! Create your custom gem collections and save newly identified rocks to them whenever and wherever you want.\r\n\r\n5. Keep track of your stone identifications.\r\n\r\nThis gem identifier allows you to track your interesting finds and stores them for you permanently. Even if it has been months since you identified that labradorite on your evening stroll, you can always access it through your snap history! \r\n\r\nWhat do you get with Rock ID?\r\n\r\n\u2022 A prompt mineral, rock, stone, gem, and fossil identifier powered by cutting-edge AI technology\r\n\u2022 Extensive and comprehensive rock descriptions\r\n\u2022 Personal custom collections with unlimited rocks\r\n\u2022 Detailed history of all stone, gem, crystal, and mineral identifications\r\n\u2022 Easy-to-navigate, user-friendly design\r\n\r\nDiscover your passion for geology with Rock ID! Dig into the vast world of gems and minerals and strike knowledge gold! \r\n\r\nSubscribe to Rock ID Premium to get unlimited access to all the app\u2019s features:\r\n\r\n\u2022 Subscriptions are billed weekly, monthly, or annually at the rate depending on the subscription plan.\r\n\u2022 Subscription automatically renews unless auto-renew is turned off at least 24 hours before the end of the current period.\r\n\r\nAll personal data is protected in accordance with the Terms of Use and Privacy Policy:\r\nhttp://aiby.mobi/rockid_android/privacy\r\nhttp://aiby.mobi/rockid_android/terms/\r\n\r\nFor any questions or inquiries, please use our customer support form at \r\nhttp://aiby.mobi/rockid_android/support/",
    "descriptionHTML": "Rock ID\u2014your digital rock identifier and guide to the world of rocks. Discover your passion for geology with our top-notch stone identifier and rock scanner! If you\u2019re into gems, rocks, stones, gemstones, and minerals and dream about assembling the ultimate collection of magic crystals, then look no further than Rock ID. With our expert stone and crystal identifier, no gem will slip through your hands! Use our swift rock scanner to recognize precious gems in mere seconds and add them to your custom collection. <br><br>What can Rock ID do?<br><br>1. Recognize stones.<br><br>Snap a picture of any gem, crystal, rock, stone, fossil, or mineral and get an instant recognition result. Powered by AI, our search engine will identify your rock out of thousands of other stones gathered in its vast database. <br><br>2. Help with gem appraisal.<br><br>It\u2019s hard to tell the difference between real and fake diamonds, pearls, and jade stones, especially if you\u2019re only starting your journey as a rock enthusiast. Use our smart AI scanner to recognize your rocks and see if you have an authentic gemstone or a similar cheaper rock.<br><br>3. Provide insightful rock facts.<br><br>Did you know that igneous rocks are formed from magma? Or that real diamonds can cut glass? You can learn all about that and even more from our stone profiles. Each rock, crystal, gem, and stone in the app has a comprehensive description of its features, history, usage, occurrence, and even interesting facts you may have never guessed!<br><br>4. Manage gemstone collections.<br><br>Never lose your marbles\u2014keep all your minerals in one place! Create your custom gem collections and save newly identified rocks to them whenever and wherever you want.<br><br>5. Keep track of your stone identifications.<br><br>This gem identifier allows you to track your interesting finds and stores them for you permanently. Even if it has been months since you identified that labradorite on your evening stroll, you can always access it through your snap history! <br><br>What do you get with Rock ID?<br><br>\u2022 A prompt mineral, rock, stone, gem, and fossil identifier powered by cutting-edge AI technology<br>\u2022 Extensive and comprehensive rock descriptions<br>\u2022 Personal custom collections with unlimited rocks<br>\u2022 Detailed history of all stone, gem, crystal, and mineral identifications<br>\u2022 Easy-to-navigate, user-friendly design<br><br>Discover your passion for geology with Rock ID! Dig into the vast world of gems and minerals and strike knowledge gold! <br><br>Subscribe to Rock ID Premium to get unlimited access to all the app\u2019s features:<br><br>\u2022 Subscriptions are billed weekly, monthly, or annually at the rate depending on the subscription plan.<br>\u2022 Subscription automatically renews unless auto-renew is turned off at least 24 hours before the end of the current period.<br><br>All personal data is protected in accordance with the Terms of Use and Privacy Policy:<br>http://aiby.mobi/rockid_android/privacy<br>http://aiby.mobi/rockid_android/terms/<br><br>For any questions or inquiries, please use our customer support form at <br>http://aiby.mobi/rockid_android/support/",
